      "statusChangeID": "5f614b7ebe52567634d3a5d9",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "Thanks for capturing these affected worlds and UI requests. The team has reviewed these items and here are our thoughts. Closing this ticket as we'll track the approved items individually.\n    *Press*: Couldn't find a matching event, not sure what they're trying to do.\n    *SendMessage*: Not allowed since you can use it to call arbitrary messages.\n    *BroadcastMessage*: Same as SendMessage.\n    *RectTransform.SetParent*: Would need an example of how this is used via UI, seems like a much better candidate for UdonBehaviour.\n    *Animator.enabled*: Coming in following release.\n    *VRCPickup.PlayHaptics*: Use UdonBehaviour with VRCPickup.PlayHaptics or VRCPlayerApi.PlayHapticEventInHand.\n    *Animator.Update*: Need to see an example of how this is used.\n    *TextMeshPro.text*: Working on adding TMPro to Udon, will whitelist this method.\n    *TextMeshProUGUI.text*: Considering TextMeshProUGUI for inclusion, would be later as it will take more work to implement our UI filtering here as well.\n    *UdonBehaviour.OnPickupUseDown*,\n    *UdonBehaviour.OnPickupUseUp*,\n   *UdonBehaviour.OnStationEntered*,\n    *UdonBehaviour.OnStationExited*,\n    *UdonBehaviour.OnVideoStart*: These events should be triggered by the actual actions.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
