      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5de9405aea7cc52772fcc359|full_name}: \nPress event is often used for triggering uGUI button(witch defines next action) from Animation on SDK2.\nFor example, even VRC_Starter Kit ( https://booth.pm/ja/items/979837 ) uses Button.Press event on SDK2.\nIt makes SDK2->SDK3 migration easier. Without it, we need reimplement uGUI Buttons like above by UdonBehavior to make it work on SDK3.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
