  "details": "Some broken worlds include:\nSquat Gym (TextMeshPro)\nhttps://www.vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_dd201c97-22b3-4e50-97f5-1759b9670db9\nUdon Dungeon.（ 拷問部屋跡。）\nhttps://www.vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_d7d54c59-4119-4511-bcaa-c623f55e6999\nSyncTest error causes problems.\nFlappy Cat\nhttps://www.vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_b473b6ba-ea16-42b4-9c3f-633e41b1e60f\n(Some settings may be affected)\nA friend's private world (Some settings were affected due to RectTransform.SetParent and GameObject.SendMessage)\nMost of these issues affected settings menus, or visual displays. For example, the Squat Gym shows 1234 in all text fields, but other logic appears to work.\nHere are some of the unique entries I collected from a couple worldhops.\n```\n2020.09.13 03:16:46 Warning    -  [UnityEventFilter] Events on 'StopAllCoroutines' were removed because one of them targeted a prohibited type 'VRCPortalMarker', method 'BroadcastMessage' or object 'VRCPortalMarker'.\n2020.09.13 03:16:46 Warning    -  [UnityEventFilter] Removed AnimationEvents from AnimationClip used by the Animator on 'StopAllCoroutines (UnityEngine.GameObject)' because the event targets 'Press' which is not allowed.\n2020.09.13 04:43:23 Warning    -  [UnityEventFilter] Events on 'ScrollView' were removed because one of them targeted a prohibited type 'GameObject', method 'SendMessage' or object 'ScrollView'.\n2020.09.13 04:43:23 Warning    -  [UnityEventFilter] Events on 'DropdownSample' were removed because one of them targeted a prohibited type 'RectTransform', method 'SetParent' or object 'Blocker'.\n2020.09.13 05:47:36 Warning    -  [UnityEventFilter] Events on 'EventIF_DisplayName' were removed because one of them targeted a prohibited type 'TMP_InputField', method 'set_text' or object 'DisplayName'.\n2020.09.13 05:47:36 Warning    -  [UnityEventFilter] Events on 'EventIF_ID' were removed because one of them targeted a prohibited type 'TextMeshProUGUI', method 'SetText' or object 'Text (TMP)'.\n2020.09.13 05:47:36 Warning    -  [UnityEventFilter] Events on 'EventIF_Teleport' were removed because one of them targeted a prohibited type 'RectTransform', method 'SetParent' or object 'EventIF_Teleport'.\n2020.09.13 06:39:58 Warning    -  [UnityEventFilter] Events on 'SyncTest' were removed because one of them targeted a prohibited type 'Animator', method 'set_enabled' or object 'SyncTest'.\n2020.09.13 06:39:58 Warning    -  [UnityEventFilter] Events on 'denma' were removed because one of them targeted a prohibited type 'VRCPickup', method 'PlayHaptics' or object 'denma (1)'.\n2020.09.13 06:39:58 Warning    -  [UnityEventFilter] Events on 'Night Mode Slider' were removed because one of them targeted a prohibited type 'Animator', method 'Update' or object 'Night Mode'.\n2020.09.12 12:21:11 Warning    -  [UnityEventFilter] Events on 'IF_Direction' were removed because one of them targeted a prohibited type 'TextMeshPro', method 'set_text' or object 'Direction'.\n2020.09.12 12:21:11 Warning    -  [UnityEventFilter] Events on 'IF_Description' were removed because one of them targeted a prohibited type 'TextMeshProUGUI', method 'set_text' or object 'Description (TMP)'.\n2020.09.12 12:21:11 Warning    -  [UnityEventFilter] Events on 'StopAllCoroutines' were removed because one of them targeted a prohibited type 'VRCPortalMarker', method 'BroadcastMessage' or object 'VRCPortalMarker'.\n2020.09.12 12:36:40 Warning    -  [UnityEventFilter] Events on 'SliderBloom' were removed because one of them targeted a prohibited type 'Animator', method 'set_enabled' or object 'Main Camera_Bloom_Max'.\n2020.09.12 12:42:03 Warning    -  [UnityEventFilter] Events on 'Button' were removed because one of them targeted a prohibited type 'UdonBehaviour', method 'OnPickupUseDown' or object 'Canvas'.\n2020.09.12 12:42:03 Warning    -  [UnityEventFilter] Events on 'Button (1)' were removed because one of them targeted a prohibited type 'UdonBehaviour', method 'OnPickupUseUp' or object 'Canvas'.\n2020.09.12 12:42:03 Warning    -  [UnityEventFilter] Events on 'Button (2)' were removed because one of them targeted a prohibited type 'UdonBehaviour', method 'OnStationEntered' or object 'Canvas'.\n2020.09.12 12:42:03 Warning    -  [UnityEventFilter] Events on 'Button (3)' were removed because one of them targeted a prohibited type 'UdonBehaviour', method 'OnStationExited' or object 'Canvas'.\n2020.09.12 12:42:03 Warning    -  [UnityEventFilter] Events on 'Button (4)' were removed because one of them targeted a prohibited type 'UdonBehaviour', method 'OnVideoStart' or object 'Canvas'.\n```",
